  "notes": [
    "Irregular -IR verb, part of the **-ducir** family (conducir, producir, reducir, traducir...)",
    "Presente yo form takes **-zco** (traduzco, not \"traduco\"); this irregular stem \"traduzc-\" carries through the entire subjuntivo presente (traduzca, traduzcas...)",
    "Pretérito indefinido uses the strong stem **traduj-** with the special ending set (-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -eron — note no \"i\" before \"eron\", unlike regular -ir verbs)",
    "Regular past participle: **traducido**",
    "Related noun: **la traducción** (translation), **el traductor/la traductora** (translator)",
    "Common usage: *traducir del inglés al español* (to translate from English to Spanish)"
  ],
